package arch_x86_64

/**
 * The names of what arch_interface declares that x86-64 doesn't implement yet, by the milestone that brings it: none
 * now.
 *
 * Missing parts are listed (decisions/0005, knowledge/roadmap.md). The arch-interface house rule (src/checks) accepts
 * these as missing, and fails once one of them is implemented, so the list stays true: take a name off when its
 * milestone adds it.
 */
NOT_YET_IMPLEMENTED :: string.[]
